2. the date the complaint was received (820.35(a)(2));
3. any unique device identifier (UDI) or universal product code (UPC), and any other device identification(s) (820.35(a)(3));
4. the name, address and phone number of the complainant (820.35(a)(4));
5. the nature and details of the complaint (820.35(a)(5));
6. any correction or corrective action taken (820.35(a)(6)); and
7. any reply to the complainant (820.35(a)(7)).

So the route is 820.35(a) together with ISO 13485 Clause 8.2.2, not 820.198.

